# This repository is a public showcase, not the source.
#
# It exists to describe the project and nothing else. The application code,
# deployment configuration, environment files and build pipeline live in a
# private repository and must never appear here.
#
# So this is a whitelist rather than a blocklist: everything is ignored, and
# only the write-up and its images are allowed back in. Dropping a source
# folder or a .env into this directory does nothing, which is the point —
# a blocklist only protects against the mistakes someone thought of in advance.

*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!docs/
!docs/**
